# CompanySite is a static site. Nothing here is required to build or run it.
#
# Build-time (set in Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Environment variables):
#
#   PUBLIC_STRIPE_PAYMENT_LINK
#     The LIVE Stripe Payment Link for the $100 down payment on the $500 Basic
#     tier, e.g. https://buy.stripe.com/aBcD1234efGh5678
#     Unset, blank, test-mode (`test_`), or malformed => /start gates to the
#     free-review intake instead of rendering a checkout button. It never
#     renders a dead link. See src/config/offers.ts.
#     Static site: changing this does nothing until the next build/deploy.
#
# Runtime (Cloudflare Pages Functions, set in the same dashboard — these are
# secrets and must never be committed):
#   RESEND_API_KEY, LEAD_TO, LEAD_FROM, N8N_LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL, N8N_LEAD_WEBHOOK_SECRET
